ssibility trees, acts on indexed elements or screenshot coordinates across tabs, and accepts delegated tasks through a bundled CLI and MCP bridge.","topics":["web-navigation","automation","tool-integration"],"updated_at":null,"url":"https://github.com/alibaba/qz-browser-agent"}
